message: "Please cite the accompanying paper; authorship is TBD."
title: "The asymptotic subrank of every Dicke tensor"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "TBD"
abstract: >-
  The entropy formula for the ordinary asymptotic subrank of every Dicke
  tensor over the complex numbers, with a coordinate-restriction lower
  bound and all original tensor modes kept separate. Includes a paper,
  ten finite algebraic targets in Lean, and exact supporting checks.
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Dicke tensors
  - asymptotic subrank
  - entropy
  - coordinate restrictions
